25-5386-8a75-39ba6aa1f15e"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"脩魚","place_name_jianti_auto":"修鱼","resolved_place_entity_id":8798,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61d5-db0e-11ef-81a7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"晋永康二年，赵王伦篡位，王盛等聚众于浊泽，谋讨伦，为伦将...","context_before":"...侯。又齐威王败魏于浊泽，围魏，魏请献观以和。《韩世家》：","source_end_index":117,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"5e9ac492-dda2-57cd-bba3-59b5a33204fb","source_start_index":95,"source_text":"宣惠王十六年，秦败我修鱼，虏将昚申差于浊泽。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"1秦敗韓師于脩魚，斬首八萬級，虜其將䱸、申差于濁澤。諸侯振恐。","content_fanyi":"秦军在修鱼击败韩军，斩首八万人，并在浊泽俘虏了韩军将领䱸和申差。各国诸侯都因此震动恐惧。","content_jianti_auto":"1秦败韩师于修鱼，斩首八万级，虏其将𫠑、申差于浊泽。诸侯振恐。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":229,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三 (周紀三) / 愼靚王 / 四年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61c6-db0e-11ef-afb4-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-317},"tongjian_id":"8c5c61c6-db0e-11ef-afb4-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"place_name":"脩魚","resolved_profile":{"entity_id":8798,"entry_list_str":"脩魚","intro":"战国时期地名，秦韩交战之地。","lat_max":35.2,"lat_min":35.0,"lon_max":114.0,"lon_min":113.8,"modern_location":"今河南省原阳县东部（原武县东）","show_map":true,"standard_name":"脩鱼","type_code":"settlement"}},"message":"success","success":true}